<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nu Skin Asia started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nu Skin Asia started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it started coverage of Nu Skin Asia Pacific Inc with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended Thursday at 28-1/4.</p>
